    "body": "<!-- issue-cleanup:triage -->\n## Triage analysis\n\n**Clarified summary**\nAjani, Nacatl Avenger's zero-loyalty ability target prompt visually covers the opponent's life total, obscuring important game information during target selection.\n\n**Investigation findings**\nThe targeting clause is typed as `any target`; the report is solely overlay layout and does not implicate card data.\n\n**Acceptance criteria**\n- Target-selection prompts do not obscure either player's life total or other essential HUD information.\n- The layout remains usable at the reported viewport and responsive sizes.\n- The same overlay behavior is corrected for all abilities using the shared target prompt.\n\n**Related issues**\nNo exact duplicate was found.\n",
